## 23. Error Handling and Graceful Degradation

The app must remain useful when an optional service is unavailable.

Examples:

- If the AI quota is exhausted, show a clear message and continue allowing manual university discovery and roadmap management.
- If live university data cannot be refreshed, show the last verified timestamp.
- If document upload fails, preserve the form state and allow retrying.
- If a reminder provider is not configured, retain the deadline in the in-app calendar.
- If a currency API is unavailable, use a student-entered conversion rate.
- If a university requirement is unknown, link to its official page and flag the missing information.
- If the student is offline, clearly distinguish cached data from current data.

Never report a successful database save, file upload, email delivery, or external application submission unless the corresponding operation actually succeeded.

